app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: Vulkan loader mele ɖoɖo sia dzi o, eyata nu aɖeke meli si wòatsɔ ata nɔnɔme o.\n\nSchist tsɔa Vulkan taa nɔnɔme, eye womeɖo `libvulkan.so.1` o.\nLoader kple driver la evẽ hia:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: Vulkan driver si session sia fia la mele afima o.\n\nWoɖo {var}, eye eƒe ɖoɖo trɔa loader la ƒe driver-didi blibo la,\nmenye be wòtsɔa nu kpee o. Eyata agbalẽ siawo siwo mele afima o\nnye driver-list blibo la -- eye Vulkan dɔwɔnu ɖe sia ɖe le session sia me\nmekpɔa driver aɖeke kura o, togbɔ be woɖo geɖewo hã:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nFiae ɖe manifest si li dzi -- driver siwo woɖo la tsɔa wo tɔwo dea\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d -- alo ɖe eƒe ɖoɖo ɖa eye nàɖe mɔ loader la nàdi etɔ.\nNe session aɖe xɔa esia tso ɖoɖogbalẽ aɖe me (Hyprland ƒe `env =`,\nsystemd environment.d drop-in, shell profile), ele be woatrɔe le afi ma,\neye ele be woage ɖe eme yeye hafi tɔtrɔ la ava dɔwɔnu siwo xɔ̃ du xoxo me.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nWoɖo {var} ɖe {value}, eye ema trɔa loader la ƒe\ndidi: ne manifest siawo dometɔ aɖeke menye mɔ̃ sia tɔ o la, eƒe ɖoɖo ɖeɖe ɖa\nnye nu gbãtɔ si woate ŋu akpɔ ɖa.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: woɖo Vulkan driver aɖeke o, eyata nu aɖeke meli si wòatsɔ ata nɔnɔme le edzi o.\n\nSchist tsɔa Vulkan taa nɔnɔme. Woɖo loader la, gake egblɔ be\ndriver aɖeke mele afima o -- nu aɖeke meŋlɔ eɖokui ɖe teƒe eve siwo wodia wo le la dometɔ aɖeke o:\n\n{dirs}\n\nWotsɔa loader la ɖe aga tso driverwo gbɔ, eyata zi geɖe la package ɖeka ko ye bu.\n\nƉo esi sɔ kple mɔ̃ sia ƒe GPU:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nNVIDIA ƒe driver si wonye etɔ ŋutɔ la tsɔa etɔ vɛ (`nvidia-utils` le Arch dzi,\n`nvidia-driver` le Debian dzi). Le virtual machine me, alo teƒe sia teƒe si\nGPU driver aɖeke mele woaɖo o la, software rasteriser ye awɔ dɔ:\n`vulkan-swrast` le Arch dzi, eye wònye `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ƒe akpa le teƒe bubuwo.\nEle blewu, gake edzea egɔme.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: woɖo Vulkan driver aɖe, gake menaa mɔ̃ aɖeke si dzi woata nɔnɔme o.\n\nƉewohĩ driver la medoa GPU sia ŋu o, alo womate ŋu aɖo eŋu o --\nle SSH dzi, alo container me la, /dev/dri bu zi geɖe.\n`vulkaninfo --summary` gblɔa nu si loader la kpɔ.\n\nSoftware rasteriser la taa nɔnɔme ne GPU mele afima kura o, ne esia ye mɔ̃ sia le: \n`vulkan-swrast` le Arch dzi, eye wònye `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ƒe akpa\nle Debian kple Fedora dzi.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ne èdi be Schist nadze egɔme ko eye nàɖe mɔ wòagbã le eƒe mɔ ŋutɔ dzi la, ɖo {var}=1.
